  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Genesis 17",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Abram was 99 years old, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " appeared to him and said, “I am the Almighty God. Obey me and always do what is right. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make my covenant with you and give you many descendants.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abram bowed down with his face touching the ground, and God said, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I make this covenant with you: I promise that you will be the ancestor of many nations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.4.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 4.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your name will no longer be Abram, but Abraham,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abraham",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This name sounds like the Hebrew for “ancestor of many nations”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " because I am making you the ancestor of many nations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will give you many descendants, and some of them will be kings. You will have so many descendants that they will become nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.55"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 1.55",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I will keep my promise to you and to your descendants in future generations as an everlasting covenant. I will be your God and the God of your descendants. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 7.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will give to you and to your descendants this land in which you are now a foreigner. The whole land of Canaan will belong to your descendants for ever, and I will be their God.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God said to Abraham, “You also must agree to keep the covenant with me, both you and your descendants in future generations. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 7.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.4.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 4.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You and your descendants must all agree to circumcise every male among you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From now on you must circumcise every baby boy when he is eight days old, including slaves born in your homes and slaves bought from foreigners. This will show that there is a covenant between you and me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.11+GEN.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.11",
              "GEN.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Each one must be circumcised, and this will be a physical sign to show that my covenant with you is everlasting. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Any male who has not been circumcised will no longer be considered one of my people, because he has not kept the covenant with me.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God said to Abraham, “You must no longer call your wife Sarai; from now on her name is Sarah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sarah",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This name in Hebrew means “princess”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will bless her, and I will give you a son by her. I will bless her, and she will become the mother of nations, and there will be kings among her descendants.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham bowed down with his face touching the ground, but he began to laugh when he thought, “Can a man have a child when he is a hundred years old? Can Sarah have a child at ninety?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He asked God, “Why not let Ishmael be my heir?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But God said, “No. Your wife Sarah will bear you a son and you will name him Isaac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17.19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Isaac",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This name in Hebrew means “he laughs”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I will keep my covenant with him and with his descendants for ever. It is an everlasting covenant. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have heard your request about Ishmael, so I will bless him and give him many children and many descendants. He will be the father of twelve princes, and I will make a great nation of his descendants. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I will keep my covenant with your son Isaac, who will be born to Sarah about this time next year.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When God finished speaking to Abraham, he left him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On that same day Abraham obeyed God and circumcised his son Ishmael and all the other males in his household, including the slaves born in his home and those he had bought. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abraham was 99 years old when he was circumcised, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and his son Ishmael was thirteen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
